@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

# Default fallback ID (Will be automatically overwritten when Request #3 runs)
@studentId = {{createStudent.response.body.data.id}}

### 1. Root / Health Check Endpoint
GET {{baseUrl}}/

### 2. Get All Students (Paginated & Sorted)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/students?page=0&size=5&sort=name,asc

### 3. Create a New Student (POST)
# @name createStudent
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alex Johnson",
  "email": "alex.john6080@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### 4. Get Student By ID (GET)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/students/{{studentId}}

### 5. Update Student (Full Update - PUT)
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/students/{{studentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alex Johnson Updated",
  "email": "alex.updated@example.com"
}

### 6. Patch Student (Partial Update - PATCH)
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/students/{{studentId}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Alex Johnson Patched new"
}

### 7. Delete Student By ID (DELETE)
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/students/{{studentId}}

### ==================================================================
### Error Handling & Validation Scenarios (RFC 9457 Testing)
### ==================================================================

### 8. Validation Error - Invalid Payload (HTTP 400)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "A",
  "email": "invalid-email-format",
  "password": "123"
}

### 9. Conflict Error - Duplicate Email (HTTP 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Duplicate User",
  "email": "alex.updated@example.com",
  "password": "SecurePassword123!"
}

### 10. Type Mismatch Error - Malformed UUID Path Variable (HTTP 400)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/students/invalid-uuid-format

### 11. Resource Not Found Error - Non-existent UUID (HTTP 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/students/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000